"entity": {
"name": "Helios Towers Plc",
"description": "Helios Towers Plc engages in the provision of telecommunications towers and related passive infrastructure. The firm provides tower site space to large MNOs and other fixed wireless operators who in turn provide wireless voice and data services to end-user subscribers. It operates through the following geographical segments: Tanzania, DRC, Congo Brazzaville, Ghana, South Africa, Senegal, Madagascar, Malari, and Oman. Helios Towers was founded in December 2009 and is headquartered in London, the United Kingdom.",
